ing when to run.<br>Scattered notes, whispers and hidden details hint at a fragmented story \u2014 one that slowly unfolds\u2026 if you dare to look in the right places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to descend into the unknown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and create essential resources to stay alive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every corner for scraps left behind\u2026 or things no one dared to touch.<br>Combine what you find to craft key items \u2014 from makeshift tools to last-minute lifesavers.<br>Not everything is useful, not everything is spare\u2026 and what you don\u2019t craft in time might cost you dearly.</p>","developers":["Valdez Brothers"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531920/9f23ce2a657666835d40d080c3dd10835544df4a/header.jpg?t=1757299152","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531920/841378/e2e25e9c6801cb337d28583660fe7c97109c2d4b/1750858625/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741158085","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531920/841378/e2e25e9c6801cb337d28583660fe7c97109c2d4b/1750858625/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741158085","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3531920/841378/e2e25e9c6801cb337d28583660fe7c97109c2d4b/1750858625/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1741158085","id":257107994,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107994/06c72b773f21